#: 9736584d623d4e34b9719f59d90386ec a074dda0f01d420dba4ab98d13cdb33b
msgid ""
"All motor/servo outputs are DShot and PWM capable. Motor outputs 1-4 are bi-"
"directional DShot capable. However, mixing DShot and normal PWM operation "
"for outputs is restricted into groups, ie. enabling DShot for an output in a"
" group requires that ALL outputs in that group be configured and used as "
"DShot, rather than PWM outputs. The output groups that must be the same (PWM"
" rate or DShot, when configured as a normal servo/motor output) are: 1-4, "
"5/6, 7/8, 9/10."
msgstr ""
"所有电机/舵机输出均支持 DShot 和 PWM。电机输出 1–4 支持双向 DShot。但是，混用 DShot 与普通 PWM "
"输出受组限制，即为某组中的某路输出启用 DShot，则该组所有输出都必须配置并用作 DShot，而非 PWM 输出。必须使用相同模式（PWM 频率或 "
"DShot，配置为普通舵机/电机输出时）的输出组为：1–4、5/6、7/8、9/10。"

